{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/the-uk-sanctions-list","content_id":"0f379d0c-0a9c-4ac4-918c-5248e1facb85","description":"Find out which people, entities and ships are designated or specified under regulations made under the Sanctions and Anti-Money Laundering Act 2018, and why.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"external","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9610703","isbn":"","title":"Search the UK Sanctions List","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://search-uk-sanctions-list.service.gov.uk/"},{"attachment_type":"external","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9610704","isbn":"","title":"ODT format UK Sanctions List","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://sanctionslist.fcdo.gov.uk/docs/UK-Sanctions-List.odt"},{"attachment_type":"external","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9610705","isbn":"","title":"ODS format UK Sanctions List","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://sanctionslist.fcdo.gov.uk/docs/UK-Sanctions-List.ods"},{"attachment_type":"external","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9610706","isbn":"","title":"XML format UK Sanctions List","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://sanctionslist.fcdo.gov.uk/docs/UK-Sanctions-List.xml"},{"attachment_type":"external","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9610707","isbn":"","title":"HTML format UK Sanctions List","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://sanctionslist.fcdo.gov.uk/docs/UK-Sanctions-List.html"},{"attachment_type":"external","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9610708","isbn":"","title":"Text format UK Sanctions List","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://sanctionslist.fcdo.gov.uk/docs/UK-Sanctions-List.txt"},{"attachment_type":"external","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9610709","isbn":"","title":"CSV format UK Sanctions List","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://sanctionslist.fcdo.gov.uk/docs/UK-Sanctions-List.csv"},{"attachment_type":"external","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9610710","isbn":"","title":"PDF format UK Sanctions List","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://sanctionslist.fcdo.gov.uk/docs/UK-Sanctions-List.pdf"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"fcdo.correspondence@fcdo.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6916e72cdb01ecfcf96fc96b","filename":"SanctionsListSchema-4.33.3.xsd"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/xml","file_size":16418,"filename":"SanctionsListSchema-4.33.3.xsd","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9610711","isbn":"","title":"UK Sanctions List schema","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6916e72cdb01ecfcf96fc96b/SanctionsListSchema-4.33.3.xsd"},{"attachment_type":"external","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9610712","isbn":"","title":"Format guide for the UK Sanctions List","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/format-guide-for-the-uk-sanctions-list"},{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9610713","isbn":"","title":"UK Sanctions List search tool: user guide","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/the-uk-sanctions-list/uk-sanctions-list-search-tool-user-guide"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\">\n<div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <p>The UK Sanctions List is now the only source for all UK sanctions designations. The OFSI Consolidated List of Asset Freeze Targets closed on Wednesday 28 January 2026 and is no longer being updated. It is <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/financial-sanctions-consolidated-list-of-targets\">available for reference purposes on its old page</a>.</p>\n\n  <p>See <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/moving-to-a-single-list-for-uk-sanctions-designations-28-january-2026\">how to manage the change</a> for further details.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"russia-list-of-entities-named-in-relation-to-financial-and-investment-restrictions\">Russia: list of entities named in relation to financial and investment restrictions</h2>\n\n<p>There is a separate list of entities subject to financial and investment restrictions under the Russia sanctions regime:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/russia-list-of-persons-named-in-relation-to-financial-and-investment-restrictions\">Entities subject to financial and investment restrictions</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"notifications-when-the-list-is-updated\">Notifications when the list is updated</h2>\n\n<p>For timely updates on all additions and changes to the sanctions list, sign up to <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/UKORGESO/subscriber/new\">get UK sanctions email alerts</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"more-information\">More information</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"how-to-challenge-a-sanctions-decision\">How to challenge a sanctions decision</h3>\n\n<p>A guide is available that covers <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/making-a-sanctions-challenge-how-to-seek-variation-or-revocation-of-a-sanctions-designation/making-a-sanctions-challenge-how-to-seek-a-variation-or-revocation-of-a-sanctions-designation\">how to seek a variation or revocation of a a sanctions designation</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"sanctions-regimes\">Sanctions regimes</h3>\n\n<p>For statutory guidance, list of designations and sanctions notices for each UK sanctions regime, go to <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/collections/uk-sanctions-regimes-under-the-sanctions-act\">Current UK sanctions regimes</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"contact\">Contact</h3>\n\n<p>For general information on sanctions or queries that relate to the UK Sanctions List: contact the Foreign, Commonwealth &amp; Development Office’s Sanctions Directorate on <a href=\"mailto:Fcdo.correspondence@fcdo.gov.uk\">Fcdo.correspondence@fcdo.gov.uk</a></p>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Made 1 variation under the Democratic Republic of the Congo sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-11-12T15:42:17Z"},{"note":"Added 11 new designations, 9 new specifications and made 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-11-12T13:38:54Z"},{"note":"Made 3 variations under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-11-10T15:01:29Z"},{"note":"Made 1 correction under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-11-03T15:57:14Z"},{"note":"Made 5 amendments under the Afghanistan sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-10-30T16:07:59Z"},{"note":"Made 1 correction under the ISIL (Da'esh) & Al-Qaida sanctions regime and 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:46:21Z"},{"note":"Made 3 variations under the ISIL (Da'esh) & Al-Qaida sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-10-27T12:05:23Z"},{"note":"Made 3 delistings under the ISIL (Da'esh) & Al-Qaida sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-10-27T10:17:13Z"},{"note":"Added 15 new designations under the Sudan sanctions regime.\r\n\r\n","public_timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:04:38Z"},{"note":"Made 3 variations under the ISIL (Da'esh) & Al-Qaida sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-10-16T09:30:50Z"},{"note":"Made 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-10-15T10:55:54Z"},{"note":"Added 2 new designations under the Iran sa