ignations under the Iran sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2026-05-11T13:32:25Z"},{"note":"Added 85 new designations under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-11T08:27:43Z"},{"note":"Added 18 designations under the Russia sanctions regime and 17 designations under the Global Irregular Migration sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-05T07:57:45Z"},{"note":"Added 1 new designation and made 3 variations under the Sudan sanctions regime. Made 17 variations under the Afghanistan sanctions regime. Made 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2026-04-29T14:05:07Z"},{"note":"Made 3 variations under the Afghanistan sanctions regime and 1 correction under the Global Human Rights sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2026-04-16T14:41:54Z"},{"note":"Made 4 variations under the Afghanistan sanctions regime and 1 administrative amendment under the Global Human Rights sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2026-04-14T13:01:10Z"},{"note":"Added 1 new designation under the ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaeda sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-31T14:15:48Z"},{"note":"Added 2 new designations under the ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaeda sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-27T11:40:48Z"},{"note":"Added 10 new designations under the Global Human Rights sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-26T09:58:02Z"},{"note":"Made 1 variation, 4 amendments and 1 revocation under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2026-03-17T15:10:11Z"},{"note":"Made 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2026-03-16T16:01:37Z"},{"note":"Made 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-12T14:00:49Z"},{"note":"Made 22 variations under the Afghanistan sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-11T17:11:37Z"},{"note":"Made 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-06T14:56:59Z"},{"note":"Made 1 revocation under the Russian sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-02T15:31:29Z"},{"note":"Made 1 delisting under the ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaida sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-02T11:01:57Z"},{"note":"Made 1 variation under the Global Anti-Corruption sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-27T16:34:23Z"},{"note":"Made 4 variations under the Sudan sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2026-02-25T15:55:29Z"},{"note":"Added 297 new designations under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-24T08:06:21Z"},{"note":"Made 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2026-02-13T10:32:49Z"},{"note":"Added 'UK Sanctions List search tool: user guide'.\r\n\r\n","public_timestamp":"2026-02-12T09:00:04Z"},{"note":"Corrected 1 designation under the Myanmar sanctions regime and 1 specification under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-10T16:45:24Z"},{"note":"Made 1 variation and 1 revocation under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-06T12:02:51Z"},{"note":"Added 6 new designations under the Sudan sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-05T09:41:49Z"},{"note":"Added 11 new designations under the Iran sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2026-02-02T14:01:37Z"},{"note":"Updated to reflect the closure of the OFSI Consolidated List on 28 January 2026. The UK Sanctions List is now the only source for all UK sanctions designations.\r\n\r\n","public_timestamp":"2026-01-28T09:00:05Z"},{"note":"Made 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2026-01-16T14:21:08Z"},{"note":"Added link to the UK Sanctions List format guide.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-22T17:35:57Z"},{"note":"Added 9 new designations under the Syria sanctions regime, and made 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-19T10:04:35Z"},{"note":"Made 24 designations under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-18T11:02:38Z"},{"note":"Made 4 revocations (de-listings) under the Syria sanctions regime, and 1 revocation (de-listing) under the Iran (Nuclear) sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2025-12-17T10:10:46Z"},{"note":"Added the new PDF format of the UK Sanctions List, and updated the links to the ODT and ODS formats.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-16T14:58:19Z"},{"note":"Added 4 new designations under the Sudan sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-12T08:57:51Z"},{"note":"Contact details for the Home Office have been updated. Made 1 de-listing under the UN Iraq sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2025-12-10T15:00:25Z"},{"note":"Added 7 new designations under the Russia sanctions regime and 2 new designations under the Cyber sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-09T14:59:47Z"},{"note":"Added 8 new designations under the Cyber sanctions regime and 4 new designations under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-04T12:00:01Z"},{"note":"Added 2 new designations under the Counter Terrorism (Domestic) sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2025-12-04T11:02:10Z"},{"note":"Added new CSV and Text formats of the UK Sanctions List, and updated the link to the HTML format. ","public_timestamp":"2025-12-03T11:19:35Z"},{"note":" Made 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2025-11-28T12:27:04Z"},{"note":"Made 1 administrative amendment under the Cyber sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-24T13:00:25Z"},{"note":"Added 6 new designations under the Cyber sanctions regime and 1 new designation under the Russia sanctions regime. Also made 1 variation under the Cyber sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-19T14:00:25Z"},{"note":"Added UK Sanctions List schema.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-14T10:43:37Z"},{"note":"Made 2 de-listings under the UN ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaida sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2025-11-07T10:39:27Z"},{"note":"Added 2 new designations under the Counter Terrorism (Domestic) sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-06T11:01:59Z"},{"note":"Made 1 variation under the Iran Sanctions Regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-03T14:50:07Z"},{"note":"Made 1 administrative amendment under the Iran sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2025-10-30T12:01:01Z"},{"note":"Added 1 new designation under the Iran sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-10-30T10:00:14Z"},{"note":"Made 4 variations and 1 administrative amendment under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2025-10-23T14:30:09Z"},{"note":"Added 13 new designations under the Global Irregular Migration and Trafficking in Persons sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-10-22T12:00:08Z"},{"note":"Added 2 new designations under the Haiti sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2025-10-20T10:00:01Z"},{"note":"Amended 1 designation under the UN ISIL (Da'esh) & Al-Qaida Sanctions Regime. ","public_timestamp":"2025-10-17T14:49:14Z"},{"note":"Made 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime. Made 1 administrative amendment under the Global Human Rights sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2025-10-16T14:01:28Z"},{"note":"Added 51 new specifications and 39 new designations under the Russia Sanctions Regime. Made 1 variation and 1 amendment under the Russia Sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-10-15T11:00:02Z"},{"note":"Added 12 new designations under the Global Human Rights sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-10-14T14:02:57Z"},{"note":"Updated page to say that the OFSI Consolidated List of Asset Freeze Targets is closing and from 28 January 2026 the UK Sanctions List will be the only source for all UK sanctions designations.","public_timestamp":"2025-10-13T12:00:04Z"},{"note":"Amended 2 designations under the Iran (Nuclear) sanctions regime and 7 designations under the UN ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaida sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2025-10-08T12:58:36Z"},{"note":"Made 2 administrative amendments under the Counter Terrorism (Domestic) sanctions regime and 1 administrative amendment under the Iran (Nuclear) sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-10-03T09:59:25Z"},{"note":"Reimposed 121 UN designations under the Iran (Nuclear) sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-10-01T09:59:36Z"},{"note":"Added 71 new designations under the Iran (Nuclear) regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-09-29T12:20:40Z"},{"note":"Added 2 new designations under the Counter-Terrorism sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-09-25T10:01:06Z"},{"note":"Made 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2025-09-23T11:30:13Z"},{"note":"Made 1 revocation (de-listing) under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-09-22T12:45:16Z"},{"note":"Added 2 new specifications and 4 new designations under the Russia Sanctions Regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-09-19T12:25:43Z"},{"note":"Made 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2025-09-18T11:00:16Z"},{"note":"Added 70 new specifications and 30 new designations under the Russia Sanctions Regime. ","public_timestamp":"2025-09-12T06:25:41Z"},{"note":"Made 1 revocation (de-listing) under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2025-09-11T12:09:18Z"},{"note":"Made 11 new designations under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-09-03T09:18:12Z"},{"note":"Made 1 amendment under the Chemical Weapons sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-08-28T10:00:31Z"},{"note":"Added 5 new designations under the Iran sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-08-21T10:59:16Z"},{"note":"Added 8 new designations under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-08-20T12:59:28Z"},{"note":"Made 1 revocation (de-listing) under the Democratic Republic of the Congo Sanctions Regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-08-15T12:03:26Z"},{"note":"Amended 1 designation under the Global Irregular Migration sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2025-08-13T13:29:56Z"},{"note":"Made 1 administrative amendment under the Global Irregular Migration sanctions regime, 2 administra