vices sanctions.","public_timestamp":"2023-03-21T14:59:07Z"},{"note":"Added 7 new designations under the Iran (Human Rights) sanctions regime","public_timestamp":"2023-03-20T11:00:04Z"},{"note":"Made 1 revocation (de-listing) under the Russia sanctions regime and 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2023-03-17T15:08:52Z"},{"note":"Made 22 administrative amendments under the Russia sanctions regime. Made 2 de-listings under the Iraq sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2023-03-10T13:07:53Z"},{"note":"Added 1 new designation under the Central African Republic sanctions regime, 1 new designation under the South Sudan sanctions regime, 2 new designations under the Iran (Human Rights) sanctions regime, 1 new designation under the Syria sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2023-03-08T11:30:13Z"},{"note":"Made 1 administrative amendment under The Democratic Republic of the Congo sanctions regime and 2 minor administrative corrections under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2023-03-07T15:14:29Z"},{"note":"Made 1 revocation (de-listing) under the Libya sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2023-02-24T12:59:50Z"},{"note":"Added 92 designations under the Russia sanctions regime. Made 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2023-02-24T07:00:35Z"},{"note":"Added 8 designations under the Iran (Human Rights) sanctions regime. Made 1 minor administrative correction under the Cyber sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2023-02-20T15:39:20Z"},{"note":"Added 3 new designations under the Global Anti-Corruption sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2023-02-10T15:28:15Z"},{"note":"Added 7 new designations under the Cyber sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2023-02-09T13:00:36Z"},{"note":"Added 15 designations under the Russia sanctions regime. Made 29 administrative changes under the the ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaida sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2023-02-08T11:00:37Z"},{"note":"Added 4 designations under the Myanmar sanctions regime and 1 designation under the ISIL (Da’esh) and and Al-Qaeda sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2023-01-31T13:59:45Z"},{"note":"Added 7 designations under the Iran (Human Rights) sanctions regime. Removed 1 duplication under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2023-01-23T12:00:11Z"},{"note":"Added 1 designation under the the ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaida sanctions regime. Made 1 minor administrative correction under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2023-01-17T14:14:22Z"},{"note":"Added 1 new designation under the Iran (Human Rights) sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2023-01-14T13:06:56Z"},{"note":"Added 1 new designation under the Haiti sanctions regime.  Made 3 minor administrative corrections under the Russia sanctions regime","public_timestamp":"2022-12-28T13:58:24Z"},{"note":"Made 1 administrative correction under the Russia sanctions regime and 1 variation under the Belarus sanctions regime.\r\n","public_timestamp":"2022-12-16T15:27:45Z"},{"note":"Added 4 designations under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-12-13T13:34:04Z"},{"note":"Added 12 designations and made 1 administrative correction under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-12-13T11:08:50Z"},{"note":"Made 2 administrative corrections under the Global Anti-Corruption regime, 3 administrative corrections under the Global Human Rights regime, 1 administrative correction under the Iran (Human Rights) regime and 1 administrative correction under the South Sudan sanctions regime. \r\n","public_timestamp":"2022-12-12T13:34:34Z"},{"note":"Added 8 new designations under the Global Human Rights regime, 5 new designations under the Global Anti-Corruption regime, 1 new designation under the Mali sanctions regime, 2 new designations under the South Sudan sanctions regime, 3 new designations under the Myanmar sanctions regime, 10 new designations under the Iran (Human Rights) regime and 1 new designation under the Russia sanction regime. ","public_timestamp":"2022-12-09T08:04:09Z"},{"note":"Added 22 new designations and made 1 administrative correction under the Russia sanctions regime.  ","public_timestamp":"2022-11-30T14:12:26Z"},{"note":"Added 24 new designations under the Iran (Human Rights) sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-11-14T14:00:02Z"},{"note":"Made 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime. Also made some minor administrative amendments under the Myanmar sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-11-11T16:45:37Z"},{"note":"Added 4 designations and made 6 administrative changes under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2022-11-02T11:00:26Z"},{"note":"Added 4 new designations under the Russia sanctions regime.  Made 1 administrative correction under the Russia sanctions regime and 1 administrative correction under the Mali sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-10-20T16:00:42Z"},{"note":"Added 8 designations under the Iran (Human Rights) regime and made 3 amendments under the Mali sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-10-10T11:09:17Z"},{"note":"Added 1 new designation under the Yemen sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-10-05T13:33:32Z"},{"note":"Made 1 designation and 1 delisting under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2022-10-04T12:00:23Z"},{"note":"Added 1 designation under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-09-30T14:19:30Z"},{"note":"Made 92 new designations under the Russia sanctions regime.  Also made 3 minor corrections under the Russia sanctions regime and 1 minor correction under the Libya sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-09-26T14:00:43Z"},{"note":"Made 1 amendment under the Libya sanctions regime. Made 68 variations, 55 minor amendments and 4 revocations under the Russia sanctions regime. Made 2 minor amendments under the Democratic People’s Republic of Korea sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-09-16T15:26:57Z"},{"note":"Made 1 amendment under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-09-06T15:00:40Z"},{"note":"Made minor administrative corrections under the Russia sanctions regime. Made 1 de-listing under the Iraq sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-09-02T11:34:42Z"},{"note":"Added 3 designations to the Myanmar sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-08-24T16:27:31Z"},{"note":"Made 41 amendments and 1 revocation under the Russia sanctions regime, and 1 amendment under the International Counter-Terrorism sanctions regime","public_timestamp":"2022-08-23T13:25:12Z"},{"note":"Changed 27 certifications from urgent to standard designations, under the Russia sanctions regime. ","public_timestamp":"2022-08-09T13:31:20Z"},{"note":"Russia sanctions regime: 2 new designations, 17 certifications from urgent to standard designations, 1 revocation and 1 amendment; Venezuela sanctions regime: 1 amendment; Democratic People’s Republic of Korea sanctions regime 44 amendments.","public_timestamp":"2022-08-02T13:39:54Z"},{"note":"Added 42 new designations under the Russia sanctions regime and 5 under the Syria sanctions regime ","public_timestamp":"2022-07-26T10:08:06Z"},{"note":"Made amendments to 7 designations under the Russia Sanctions Regime and to 1 designation under the Libya Sanctions Regime","public_timestamp":"2022-07-20T13:21:47Z"},{"note":"Made amendments to 19 designations under the Russia sanctions regime and amendments to 6 designations under the Belarus sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-07-12T14:39:23Z"},{"note":"Made 1 variation under the Belarus sanctions regime","public_timestamp":"2022-07-07T10:28:34Z"},{"note":"Added 2 new designations under the Russia sanctions regime; made amendments to 3 designations under the Russia sanctions regime and 1 designation under the Democratic People’s Republic of Korea regime; revoked 9 designations from the Cyber sanctions regime and 4 designations under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-07-05T16:32:19Z"},{"note":"Added 7 new designations under the Russia sanctions regime; made 43 amendments and 2 variations to designations under the Russia sanctions regime.\r\n","public_timestamp":"2022-07-04T16:11:32Z"},{"note":"Added 13 new designations under the Russia sanctions regime and 7 new designations under the Syria sanctions regime.  Made administrative corrections to 2 listings under the Russia regime and 1 listing under the Myanmar regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-06-29T10:00:56Z"},{"note":"Made amendments to 58 designations under the Russia sanctions regime, to 1 designation under the Myanmar regime and made administrative changes to 57 designations under the ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaeda regime.\r\n","public_timestamp":"2022-06-24T11:34:52Z"},{"note":"Added 12 new designations under the Russia sanctions regime and 6 new designations under the Myanmar sanctions regime. Made administrative changes to listings under the Russia, ISIL (Da’esh) and Al-Qaeda regimes.","public_timestamp":"2022-06-16T10:21:04Z"},{"note":"Made amendments to 37 designations under the Russia sanctions regime and to 6 designations under the ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaida sanctions regime.\r\n","public_timestamp":"2022-06-14T13:46:50Z"},{"note":"List updated: 299 amendments to designations under the Russia regime; 9 amendments to designations under the cyber regime; and 6 amendments to designations under the Belarus regime.\r\n","public_timestamp":"2022-05-27T14:00:21Z"},{"note":"Amendments to 63 designations under the Russia sanctions regime","public_timestamp":"2022-05-24T13:36:28Z"},{"note":"Three de-listings from the Iraq regime, five amendments / corrections to the Russia regime and two amendments to the Syria regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-05-20T11:59:49Z"},{"note":"Added 3 new designations under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-05-19T09:02:33Z"},{"note":"Amendments made to a number of designations under the Syria regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-05-13T13:25:13Z"},{"note":"Added 12 new designations under the Russia regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-05-13T10:01:58Z"},{"note":"Made amendments to 88 designations under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-05-09T16:39:10Z"},{"note":"Added 1 new designation and made 1 amendment under the Russia regime. ","public_timestamp":"2022-05-05T16:00:09Z"},{"note":"Added 63 new designations under the Russia regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-05-04T12:01:44Z"},{"note":"Made amendments to 195 designations under the Russia sanctions regime","public_timestamp":"2022-04-26T13:58:10Z"},{"note":"Added 26 new designations under the Russia regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-21T10:04:27Z"},{"note":"Three de-listings for the Iraq regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-19T12:00:07Z"},{"note":"Added 2 new listings under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-14T14:46:02Z"},{"note":"Added 206 new listings under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-13T10:16:54Z"},{"note":"Two new designations under the Bosnia and Herzegovina regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-11T11:15:43Z"},{"note":"Added 3 new listings under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-08T09:00:36Z"},{"note":"Added 9 new listings and made 1 variation under the Russia sanctions regime","public_timestamp":"2022-04-06T14:50:10Z"},{"note":"1 adminstrative correction under the Russia sanctions regime and 1 administrative correction under the ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaida sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-05T13:02:32Z"},{"note":"Made 2 amendments under the ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaida sanctions regime and 1 amendment under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-04T12:00:10Z"},{"note":"There have been 3 additions made under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-31T15:29:46Z"},{"note":"There have been 14 additions made under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-31T09:47:55Z"},{"note":"Amendments made to 3 listings under the Russia regime and 1 listing under the Belarus regime. 1 delisting under the Russia regime and 2 minor corrections under the Russia and Chemical Weapons regimes.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-30T16:14:26Z"},{"note":"Added 6 new listings under the Myanmar sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-25T14:55:08Z"},{"note":"Added one new designation under the cyber sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-24T20:48:55Z"},{"note":"Added 59 new listings under the Russia sanctions regime and 6 new listings under the Belarus sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-24T09:00:18Z"},{"note":"Variations to a number of designations under the Zimbabwe, Belarus and Chemical Weapons sanctions regimes.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-18T12:32:08Z"},{"note":"Added 14 new listings under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-15T18:19:30Z"},{"note":"Added 350 new listings under the Russia sanctions regime and 9 new listings under the Cyber sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-15T11:56:30Z"},{"note":"Variations to 44 designations under the international counter-terrorism regime, and one variation under the domestic counter-terrorism regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-11T16:29:57Z"},{"note":"Added 386 new listings under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-11T11:35:18Z"},{"note":"Variations to 5 designations under the Republic of Guinea-Bissau sanctions regime","public_timestamp":"2022-03-10T12:04:02Z"},{"note":"Added 7 new designations under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-10T09:05:34Z"},{"note":"Added 1 new listing under the ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaida regime and 4 minor corrections under the Iran (nuclear) regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-08T12:30:15Z"},{"note":"Variations to a number of designations under the Iran (Nuclear) regime. 7 revocations under the Iraq regime and 2 revocations under the ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaida regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-04T17:25:46Z"},{"note":"Added 2 new listings under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-03T19:44:20Z"},{"note":"Variations to a number of designations under The Democratic Republic of the Congo, South Sudan and The Democratic People's Republic of Korea regimes. 1 revocation under The Democratic Republic of the Congo regime.\r\n","public_timestamp":"2022-03-03T14:59:53Z"},{"note":"Added 2 new listings under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-01T16:41:07Z"},{"note":"Added 6 new listings under the Russia sanctions regime and 1 new listing under the Yemen sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-01T12:20:34Z"},{"note":"Added 1 new listing under the Russia sanctions regime","public_timestamp":"2022-03-01T07:50:04Z"},{"note":"Added 3 new listings under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-02-28T15:45:48Z"},{"note":"Removed the old formats of the UK Sanctions List from this page - they were retired on 28 February 2022.","public_timestamp":"2022-02-28T12:35:12Z"},{"note":"Added two new listings under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-02-25T19:15:14Z"},{"note":"Added 11 new listings under the Russia sanctions regime","public_timestamp":"2022-02-24T17:04:52Z"},{"note":"Administrative corrections to two listings under the Russia sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-02-22T20:12:09Z"},{"note":"Added 8 new listings under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019.","public_timestamp":"2022-02-22T12:42:03Z"},{"note":"One addition to the Somalia regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-02-21T15:04:22Z"},{"note":"Administrative corrections made to the 4 new formats of the UK Sanctions List.  No changes have been made to actual designations or listings.","public_timestamp":"2022-02-18T16:29:01Z"},{"note":"Administrative corrections made to the 4 new formats of the UK sanctions list.  No changes have been made to actual designations or listings.","public_timestamp":"2022-02-14T17:29:04Z"},{"note":"One variation to a listing under the Belarus regime and one amendment to a listing under the Venezuela regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-02-04T15:06:09Z"},{"note":"Added new formats of the UK Sanctions List. \r\nAdded 3 new listings under the Myanmar regime and 1 amendment to a listing under the Libya regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-01-31T15:04:04Z"},{"note":"Variations to a number of designations under the Venezuela and Iran (Human Rights) regimes, as well as four revocations under the Iran (Human Rights) regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-01-28T15:00:15Z"},{"note":"One delisting under the ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaida regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-01-25T16:00:20Z"},{"note":"One revocation and one addition under the Libya regime; three delistings under the ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaida regime","public_timestamp":"2022-01-19T10:36:30Z"},{"note":"Added samples of new Sanctions List structure and formats","public_timestamp":"2022-01-17T15:20:51Z"},{"note":"Two additions to the Global Human Rights regime.","public_timestamp":"2022-01-13T15:43:40Z"},{"note":"Five listings removed and two additions made under the ISIL regime. Some other minor amendments also made.","public_timestamp":"2022-01-06T13:10:42Z"},{"note":"Updated to include 2 new UN designations, under the ISIL (Daesh) and Central African Republic regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-12-22T14:00:01Z"},{"note":"Four new listings under the Myanmar regime and one under the Global Human Rights regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-12-10T15:30:37Z"},{"note":"Two listings removed from the Iraq regime and three minor amendments under the Yemen regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-12-09T13:30:05Z"},{"note":"New designations under the Belarus regime and minor changes to two listings under the Syria regime and two listings under the Russia regime","public_timestamp":"2021-12-02T15:00:10Z"},{"note":"Technical corrections made to the list published on 26 November 2021. No designations have been made, varied or revoked.","public_timestamp":"2021-11-30T13:28:08Z"},{"note":"One new listing under the ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaida regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-11-26T18:50:14Z"},{"note":"Eight new listings under the Nicaragua regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-11-15T14:31:13Z"},{"note":"Three new listings under the Yemen regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-11-10T18:38:47Z"},{"note":"One new listing under the Libya regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-10-26T11:02:59Z"},{"note":"Delistings under the Syria regime and one amendment under the Myanmar regime. ","public_timestamp":"2021-09-30T11:02:48Z"},{"note":"Publication to correct the UK Sanctions List due to a technical error","public_timestamp":"2021-09-23T11:00:36Z"},{"note":"One delisting under Iraq regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-09-22T11:04:54Z"},{"note":"A number of delistings from the Iraq regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-09-09T12:08:16Z"},{"note":"One delisting under ISIL (Da’esh) and Al-Qaida regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-09-07T12:38:42Z"},{"note":"New listings under the Myanmar regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-09-02T12:00:31Z"},{"note":"Seven new listings under the chemical weapons regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-08-20T10:59:10Z"},{"note":"One delisting under the Syria regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-08-12T10:56:43Z"},{"note":"A new designation and variations to seven existing designations under the Belarus regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-08-09T11:10:04Z"},{"note":"A correction to the name of one of the regulations.","public_timestamp":"2021-08-02T14:52:47Z"},{"note":"New designations under the global anti-corruption regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-07-22T12:00:36Z"},{"note":"One new designation under the Belarus regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-07-21T12:00:02Z"},{"note":"Amendments to one listing under the GHR regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-07-16T11:09:44Z"},{"note":"Amendments made under Belarus and Syria regimes.","public_timestamp":"2021-07-12T12:00:12Z"},{"note":"One delisting made under Belarus regime and one delisting made under Syria regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-07-08T11:05:40Z"},{"note":"Delisting made under Iraq regime and one amendment made under Russia regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-07-01T11:00:13Z"},{"note":"One amendment made under Belarus regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-06-25T11:00:35Z"},{"note":"This update corrects a technical error that arose from publication on 22 June.","public_timestamp":"2021-06-24T16:40:04Z"},{"note":"This update corrects a technical error that arose when we uploaded the new designations under the Myanmar and Belarus regimes on 21 June.","public_timestamp":"2021-06-22T14:34:22Z"},{"note":"New designations under Myanmar and Belarus regimes and one amendment under Russia regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-06-21T14:30:09Z"},{"note":"New designation under ISIL (Da’esh) and Al-Qaida and one amendment under Russia regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-06-18T11:00:21Z"},{"note":"New designation under Myanmar regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-05-17T14:30:49Z"},{"note":"New designations and one amendment under Libya regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-05-13T11:00:33Z"},{"note":"Amendments made to designations in Libya regime. ","public_timestamp":"2021-04-30T11:00:17Z"},{"note":"Previous listings revoked under the Burma regime. New designations made under the Myanmar regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-04-29T16:00:37Z"},{"note":"New designations made under the global anti-corruption sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-04-26T16:00:07Z"},{"note":"Designations delisted under Iraq regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-04-16T10:00:11Z"},{"note":"Designation amended under ISIL (Da’esh) and Al-Qaida regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-04-07T15:00:03Z"},{"note":"Designation delisted under Central African Republic regime, designation amended under Yemen regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-04-06T14:00:00Z"},{"note":"New designation made under Global Human Rights regime. Amendments made to information under some regimes.","public_timestamp":"2021-04-01T10:00:04Z"},{"note":"New designation made under Global Human Rights regime. Amendments made to information under some regimes. ","public_timestamp":"2021-03-25T13:00:06Z"},{"note":"Amendments made to information for some regimes.","public_timestamp":"2021-03-24T11:42:58Z"},{"note":"New designations added under the Global Human Rights sanctions regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-03-22T15:15:26Z"},{"note":"New designations added under Syria regime. Information for some designations has been amended.","public_timestamp":"2021-03-15T10:00:03Z"},{"note":"Removed a person listed under the Sudan regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-03-08T13:03:52Z"},{"note":"Three new designations under the Somalia regime.","public_timestamp":"2021-03-02T10:55:41Z"},{"note":"A new listing under the Yemen regime and minor changes to 2 other designations.","public_timestamp":"2021-02-26T16:16:50Z"},{"note":"Six new listings under the Burma sanctions regime, and some factual updates to other designations.","public_timestamp":"2021-02-25T12:00:18Z"},{"note":"New designations added under Belarus and Burma regimes. Information for some designations has been amended.","public_timestamp":"2021-02-18T15:00:54Z"},{"note":"New designations added under Zimbabwe regime. Information for some designations has been amended.","public_timestamp":"2021-02-01T11:00:14Z"},{"note":"Information for some designations has been amended.","public_timestamp":"2021-01-20T15:00:07Z"},{"note":"Removal of designations from Iraq regime. Information for some designations has been amended.","public_timestamp":"2021-01-19T13:26:06Z"},{"note":"Information for some designations has been amended.","public_timestamp":"2021-01-08T12:34:46Z"},{"note":"The UK's sanctions framework has changed.","public_timestamp":"2020-12-31T23:00:25Z"},{"note":"New designations added under the Global Human Rights Sanctions regime in response to serious human rights violations in Venezuela, Russia, The Gambia and Pakistan\r\n","public_timestamp":"2020-12-10T15:30:59Z"},{"note":"New desig